# The Gobbiebag Part II (jeuno 28): reqsMet's operands one at a time, in both checks. Part I completed. The inventory at
# 30 (a fresh char): no section (43 (81)); at 35 (storage, a GM's player:changeContainerSize): Part I set accepted (a
# GM): no section; all met: 43 (36, 0, 1), begun. Accepted: Part I accepted: no section (Part I itself: its size 30
# unmet); all met: 43 (36, 1, 1). A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it
# completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # the inventory 30, not 35: no section; 43 (81)
finish
storage inventory 35                    # a GM's player:changeContainerSize to the part's start size
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI accepted  # a GM: Part I not completed
trigger Bluffnix                        # no section (Part I: inventory 35 is not its 30); 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (36, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI accepted  # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the previous part not completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (36, 1, 1)
finish
